
### 장바구니 상품 추가
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 9,
  "weightGram": 5000,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 장바구니 상품 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Accept: application/json


### 장바구니 상품 수량 변경
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### 장바구니 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1
